        "created_at": "2021-03-14T03:23:29.193Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I actually had one of these as an idea when I was working on test PCs to learn the system. I just had the Metal power to represent manipulating stuff (ripping apart a train, or something), while Telekinesis was actually moving the metal around.</p>",
